  "goodToKnow": "Der Bulle is a bull, a male bovine. In slang, die Bullen are the cops, a disrespectful term: calling an officer Bulle to their face can be prosecuted as a Beleidigung (insult). On the stock market, der Bulle is an optimist and der Bär a pessimist, as at the Frankfurt stock exchange, where bull and bear statues stand outside. It's a weak noun: den Bullen. Die Bulle (feminine) is a papal bull, a different word."
